"values": ["", "So persistent...", "Congratulations you did it", "But what do you think
happens now?", "After I became this, I
harnessed the powerful
artifact that I had 
and my conscious mind returned", "I can tell that my thinking, 
desires and perspective
changed by the form I have
taken, but I also gathered new
understanding", "You see, some time
after I die,
everything will reset
and all will start anew,
endlessly", "That is for me, but also for you,
our conscious minds will diverge
into different branches
and it will be as if nothing happened
at all", "But maybe you can fetch
something previously 
unreachable and unattainable", "A key to new possibilities", "", ""]
}
